<t>Module: std/crypto/hmac.ts (nish/crypto/hmac). HMAC (<xref target="HMAC"/>)
instantiated with SHA-256, SHA-384 and SHA-512 as <xref target="RFC4231"/> defines it,
held to every RFC 4231 test vector, with its tag checks held to accept the
right tag and refuse a tampered one.</t>
